{
  "id": 7907,
  "title": "解读 PyTorch Profiler 追踪",
  "meta_title": "分析 PyTorch Profiler 追踪",
  "meta_description": "阅读并理解追踪堆栈，以找出 GPU 空闲时间和内核启动开销。",
  "content": "<p><code>nvidia-smi</code> 报告的高使用率数字常会使工程师误认为他们的训练管线很高效。一个通用的使用率指标只表示 CUDA 内核驻留在设备上；它不能区分高吞吐量 (throughput)的矩阵乘法和内存受限的操作，也无法说明设备正在等待来自 CPU 或网络的数据。为了有效优化 FSDP 训练，必须绕过高层级指标，直接通过追踪文件分析执行时间线。</p>\n<h3>GPU 追踪的组成</h3>\n<p>在 Perfetto 或 Chrome Trace Viewer 中查看时，标准的 PyTorch 分析器追踪将执行数据组织成水平轨迹。对于 NVIDIA GPU 上的分布式训练，有三类特定的轨迹提供了性能调试所需的信号。</p>\n<p><strong>CPU Python 线程</strong>轨迹显示了高层级的应用逻辑，包括 <code>nn.Module</code> 调用和数据加载器循环。在此之下是 <strong>CPU CUDA 运行时</strong>轨迹，它记录了对 CUDA 驱动程序进行的 API 调用（例如 <code>cudaLaunchKernel</code>、<code>cudaMemcpyAsync</code>）。最后，<strong>GPU 流</strong>轨迹可视化了内核在硬件上的实际执行情况。</p>\n<p>在优化的 FSDP 设置中，这些轨迹之间的关系是严格分层但异步的。CPU 将内核分派到启动队列，GPU 消耗它们。性能下降通常表现为这种生产者-消费者关系的破裂。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-qr72on\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph G {\n    rankdir=TB;\n    node [shape=box, style=filled, fontname=\"Helvetica\", fontsize=10];\n    edge [fontname=\"Helvetica\", fontsize=9];\n\n    subgraph cluster_cpu {\n        label = \"主机 (CPU)\";\n        style = filled;\n        color = \"#e9ecef\";\n        python [label=\"Python 解释器\\n(FSDP 前向/反向)\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", color=\"#1c7ed6\"];\n        runtime [label=\"CUDA 运行时 API\\n(内核启动)\", fillcolor=\"#bac8ff\", color=\"#4263eb\"];\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_gpu {\n        label = \"设备 (GPU)\";\n        style = filled;\n        color = \"#e9ecef\";\n        stream_c [label=\"计算流\\n(GEMM / 逐元素操作)\", fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\", color=\"#37b24d\"];\n        stream_n [label=\"NCCL 流\\n(AllGather / ReduceScatter)\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\", color=\"#f03e3e\"];\n    }\n\n    python -> runtime [label=\" 分派\"];\n    runtime -> stream_c [label=\" 异步启动\"];\n    runtime -> stream_n [label=\" 异步启动\"];\n    stream_c -> stream_n [label=\" 同步\\n(事件等待)\", style=dashed];\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-qr72on\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>分布式环境中主机分派与设备执行流之间的交互。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>找出 CPU 限制的执行</h3>\n<p>大规模训练中常见的病症是“GPU 饥饿”，即 GPU 完成工作队列的速度快于 CPU 补充的速度。在分析器追踪中，这表现为 GPU 流轨迹上块之间的空白或间隙。</p>\n<p>如果观察到每次内核执行之间存在小的、明显的间隙，则系统存在启动开销问题。PyTorch 的即时执行会为每次内核启动带来固定成本（大约 3-10 微秒）。当 FSDP 封装一个包含许多小层的模型（例如隐藏维度相对于批大小较低的 Transformer）时，启动开销与计算时间的比率会增加。</p>\n<p>这里要关注的指标是 GPU 时间线的相对密度。在一个健康的追踪中，内核块紧密排列，呈现为实心的颜色条。明显的空白表示 CPU 在图序列化方面遇到困难。这通常通过启用 <code>torch.compile</code> 来融合逐点操作得到解决，从而减少每步所需的内核启动总数。</p>\n<h3>通信与计算重叠</h3>\n<p>FSDP 很大程度上依赖于通信（NCCL 操作）与计算的重叠。在前向传播期间，当 GPU 计算第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 层时，系统应同时 <code>AllGather</code> 第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 层的参数 (parameter)。</p>\n<p>为了验证此行为，请在 GPU 轨迹中找到 <strong>NCCL</strong> 内核。这些内核通常被标记 (token)为 <code>ncclKernel</code>、<code>ncclAllGatherRingLL</code> 或根据后端版本而定的类似变体。应该看到这些通信内核在与计算内核（例如 <code>sgemm</code>、<code>elementwise_kernel</code>）并行的一个单独流上执行。</p>\n<p>如果 NCCL 内核和计算内核按序执行，即一个流空闲而另一个流活跃，则表示重叠配置失败。这种按序执行是由于不当的 CUDA 流优先级设置或 NCCL 进程组配置中的限制造成的。</p>\n<p>这种重叠的效率是可以量化 (quantization)的。设 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{compute}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为层的前向/反向传播 (backpropagation)所需时间，而 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{comm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为收集或分散其参数所需时间。暴露的通信开销 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{exposed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{exposed} = \\max(0, T_{comm} - T_{compute})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{exposed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 趋近于零时，会发生理想的扩展。如果分析器显示 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{comm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 明显超过 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{compute}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则网络带宽是瓶颈，简单地增加更多 GPU 可能无法线性提升训练速度。</p>\n<h3>分析反向传播 (backpropagation)结构</h3>\n<p>FSDP 中的反向传播很复杂，因为它涉及两种不同的通信原语：<code>AllGather</code>（用于获取完整参数 (parameter)以进行梯度计算）和 <code>ReduceScatter</code>（用于同步梯度并立即对其进行分片）。</p>\n<p>反向传播的追踪应显示跨流的“之字形”模式。当第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span> 层的反向计算完成后：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span> 层梯度的 <code>ReduceScatter</code> 操作在通信流上开始。</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 层参数的 <code>AllGather</code> 操作开始（预取）。</li>\n<li>计算流执行第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 层的反向传播。</li>\n</ol>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-6cgcmx\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"title\": \"理想的 FSDP 反向传播重叠\",\n    \"height\": 300,\n    \"margin\": {\"l\": 100, \"r\": 20, \"t\": 40, \"b\": 20},\n    \"xaxis\": {\n      \"title\": \"时间 (微秒)\",\n      \"showgrid\": true,\n      \"zeroline\": false\n    },\n    \"yaxis\": {\n      \"showgrid\": false,\n      \"zeroline\": false,\n      \"ticktext\": [\"计算流\", \"NCCL 流\"],\n      \"tickvals\": [1, 0]\n    },\n    \"showlegend\": true\n  },\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"bar\",\n      \"y\": [1, 1, 1],\n      \"x\": [300, 300, 300],\n      \"base\": [0, 350, 700],\n      \"orientation\": \"h\",\n      \"name\": \"计算 (反向)\",\n      \"marker\": {\"color\": \"#339af0\"},\n      \"text\": [\"第 N 层\", \"第 N-1 层\", \"第 N-2 层\"],\n      \"textposition\": \"auto\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"bar\",\n      \"y\": [0, 0, 0],\n      \"x\": [200, 200, 200],\n      \"base\": [50, 400, 750],\n      \"orientation\": \"h\",\n      \"name\": \"通信 (ReduceScatter)\",\n      \"marker\": {\"color\": \"#fa5252\"},\n      \"text\": [\"梯度 N\", \"梯度 N-1\", \"梯度 N-2\"],\n      \"textposition\": \"auto\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"bar\",\n      \"y\": [0, 0],\n      \"x\": [250, 250],\n      \"base\": [0, 350],\n      \"orientation\": \"h\",\n      \"name\": \"通信 (AllGather 预取)\",\n      \"marker\": {\"color\": \"#fcc419\"},\n      \"text\": [\"参数 N-1\", \"参数 N-2\"],\n      \"textposition\": \"auto\"\n    }\n  ]\n}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 300px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-6cgcmx\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 300px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>描述理想流并发的甘特图。注意相邻层的通信操作如何与当前层的计算同时执行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>在次优的追踪中，你将观察到 CPU 轨迹上的“等待”内核（通常表示为 <code>cudaStreamSynchronize</code> 或 <code>cudaEventSynchronize</code>）持续较长时间。这表明 Python 代码在等待 GPU 完成通信事件后才能分派下一个计算内核，这违背了异步执行的目的。</p>\n<h3>内存分配器碎片化</h3>\n<p>除了计算和通信，分析器还显露了内存管理开销。频繁调用 <code>cudaMalloc</code> 和 <code>cudaFree</code> 代价高昂。PyTorch 使用缓存分配器来缓解此问题，但在 FSDP 中，对完整参数 (parameter)分片的持续分配和释放可能导致碎片化。</p>\n<p>在分析器中，查看内存时间线轨迹。当层被实例化和丢弃时，FSDP 中出现锯齿模式是预期且正常的。但是，如果在训练步骤中间（不仅仅是前几次迭代）看到 <code>cudaMalloc</code> 调用激增，这表明缓存分配器正在频繁地重新分配。分配器被迫寻找空闲块或拆分现有块，这会阻塞 CPU 分派线程。这通常通过设置 <code>PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF</code> 环境变量来调整 <code>max_split_size_mb</code> 得到纠正，从而强制分配器保留更大的连续块以供周期性参数扩展使用。</p>",
